                                                "sense_id": "602b9c4d-a167-3dd5-b90c-aa39b6b8205c",
                                                "text": "For Ms. Park, a forensic chemist for the New Jersey State Police who has since retired, bulgogi was a weeknight workhorse, even without the convenience of pre-sliced meat."
